<div class="content-box" style="background: #fff3cd; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;">
    <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> Watch Out For</h2>
    <p>Common misconceptions to avoid:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Switches vs. Routers: Believing they perform the same task; students must distinguish between MAC-based local delivery and IP-based global routing.</li>
        <li>WiFi = Internet: Assuming a wireless connection inherently provides internet access, ignoring the role of the gateway.</li>
        <li>Encryption: Thinking Symmetric encryption is "weak" rather than just having a different use-case (speed) compared to Asymmetric (key exchange).</li>
    </ul>
</div>

